    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Consists of (i) 163,636 shares of Common Stock underlying performance-based restricted stock units (&quot;PSUs&quot;) and (ii) 109,091 shares of Common Stock underlying restricted stock units (&quot;RSUs&quot;). Each PSU and RSU represents a contingent right to receive one share of Common Stock. The PSUs consist of three equal tranches, each of which vests on the later of the date that (a) a specified Issuer stock price performance target is met within five years after the grant date and (b) a specified date, subject to the Reporting Person's continued employment through such later date. The RSUs will vest in one-third installments on August 1 of each of 2026, 2027 and 2028, subject to the Reporting Person's continued employment through each such date.</footnote>
